							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Druid-  Heals and DPS<br />ShadowKnight- Tank(great At holding Aggro) and nice Mana Buff<br />Enchanter- Slows, Mezz, Buffs, and little Dps<br />Wizard- DPS-DPS-DPS-DPS-DPS<br />Necro - mana and DPS<br />Pally or 2nd Sk- DPS-DPS and Pally Group Heal<br /><br />There is no faster killing group than this!!!<br />
